---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Feels Like Om</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Feels Like Om</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <details>
          <summary>ABOUT</summary>
          <div class="submenu">
            <a href="/about/our-story">Our story</a>
            <a href="/about/getting-to-sikkim">Getting to Sikkim</a>
            <a href="/about/visa-and-permits">Visa and permits</a>
          </div>
        </details>
        <a href="/journeys">JOURNEYS</a>
        <a href="/reflections">REFLECTIONS</a>
        <a href="/contact">CONTACT</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="overlay"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>Who you are matters.</h1>
          <p>
            Slow down.<br />
            Make space for yourself.<br />
            Learn from the land and its people.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="people" aria-labelledby="people-heading">
        <div class="people-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND FEELS LIKE OM</p>
          <h2 id="people-heading">Hi, we’re Zi Hui and Elan.</h2>

          <article class="person zi-hui">
            <div class="portrait-wrap">
              <img src="/zi-hui.JPG" alt="Zi Hui walking through a village in Sikkim" />
            </div>
            <div class="person-copy">
              <p class="person-name">Zi Hui</p>
              <blockquote>“A tree helped me forgive myself.”</blockquote>
              <a class="story-link" href="/about/our-story#zi-hui">Read Zi Hui’s story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    background: #f4efe5;
    color: #18301f;
  }

  .site-header {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 4%;
    color: white;
  }

  .brand {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .main-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .main-nav > a,
  summary {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  details {
    position: relative;
  }

  summary {
    list-style: none;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .submenu {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.7rem;
    right: 0;
    width: max-content;
    min-width: 12rem;
    padding: 0.7rem;
    background: rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.96);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.18);
  }

  .submenu a {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
    color: #18301f;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100svh;
    background: url('/hero-river.JPG') center / cover no-repeat;
    color: white;
  }

  .overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.58) 0%, rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.22) 42%, rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.02) 68%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: absolute;
    top: 18%;
    left: 4%;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 92vw;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hero p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .people {
    background: #f4efe5;
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 4%;
  }

  .people-inner {
    width: min(1180px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .people h2 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .person {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }

  .portrait-wrap {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: #d8d1c3;
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
  }

  .portrait-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 42%;
  }

  .person-name {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0 0 2.2rem;
    max-width: 13ch;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  .story-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    color: inherit;
    text-underline-offset: 0.35rem;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header {
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .main-nav {
      gap: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .submenu {
      right: auto;
      left: 0;
    }

    .hero {
      background-position: 62% center;
    }

    .overlay {
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.52) 0%, rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.16) 48%, rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.04) 72%);
    }

    .hero-content {
      top: 14%;
      left: 1.25rem;
      right: 1.25rem;
      max-width: none;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 13vw, 4.5rem);
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 28rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .people {
      padding: 4.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
    }

    .people h2 {
      margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    }

    .person {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .portrait-wrap {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    }

    blockquote {
      max-width: 10ch;
    }
  }
</style>
